fin-strategy:FactorObservationShape a sh:NodeShape;
    sh:description "Factor Observation, is a temporal and provenanced observation that records the value of one factor version for one factor subject, observation period, and run context, used for managing revisions through a stable logical identity plus knowledge-time closure, with an optional link to the prior exact fact version. The factor subject is generalized beyond a single instrument via the FactorSubject role family so that macro, sector, country, market-breadth, curve, and portfolio factors are not forced to masquerade as instruments; the observation period is a structured ObservationPeriod rather than a free-text key; and the run context is part of the stable logical key so that observations of the same factor and subject in different runs do not collide.";
    sh:name "Factor Observation";
    sh:property <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/strategy-research/FactorObservation/shape/attribute/53ef079103a5b1000d3eecaa>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/strategy-research/FactorObservation/shape/attribute/540c02c29d9ab85fd6314850>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/strategy-research/FactorObservation/shape/attribute/8460ab0b07670c29168a5142>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/strategy-research/FactorObservation/shape/attribute/973c7b2d0e19fe1df2563ec2>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/strategy-research/FactorObservation/shape/attribute/d4fb445c16e870d66a4e0bcf>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/strategy-research/FactorObservation/shape/immutable-version/1546f4be8593f8b2da423607>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/strategy-research/FactorObservation/shape/immutable-version/af9bccfcc999a1901c9cfbc3>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/strategy-research/FactorObservation/shape/participant-role-factorCurrency/6d4530e727d0343ec151934b>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/strategy-research/FactorObservation/shape/participant-role-factorIndex/6a74b24881a04482331a6707>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/strategy-research/FactorObservation/shape/participant-role-factorInstrument/b5d1038546316fa6b919cbfc>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/strategy-research/FactorObservation/shape/participant-role-factorIssuer/aeeaeb73521b8c7b1c931c9b>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/strategy-research/FactorObservation/shape/participant-role-factorListing/b961c0c60baad05def50e45e>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/strategy-research/FactorObservation/shape/participant-role-factorMarket/6b8988b7a28cfc04dce4cd2a>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/strategy-research/FactorObservation/shape/participant-role-factorPortfolio/d9353c9ab09a0668894570ba>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/strategy-research/FactorObservation/shape/participant-role-factorRunContext/1a8eea0fa515e03bf5b49931>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/st