fin-strategy:PositionAttributionShape a sh:NodeShape;
    sh:description "Position Attribution, is a temporal and provenanced fact that attributes one position snapshot or position lot to a signal-generator and run context, used for carrying a single Money or Quantity contribution under one metric and calculation context without creating a Portfolio-to-Strategy dependency cycle. The attribution optionally links to the PerformanceObservation it explains via attributionForPerformance, and to an AttributionMethod that defines the component type, aggregation scope, and reconciliation and residual rule, so that the attribution explains a performance result rather than only carrying a number.";
    sh:name "Position Attribution";
    sh:property <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/strategy-research/PositionAttribution/shape/attribute/335d37e0f9aec2b9dddae3c8>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/strategy-research/PositionAttribution/shape/attribute/4ba75dcdb8b4d9d141f45c32>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/strategy-research/PositionAttribution/shape/attribute/a6baf3c476fe49bc503878b8>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/strategy-research/PositionAttribution/shape/attribute/cddec323cbe68ee259a4ea5f>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/strategy-research/PositionAttribution/shape/attribute/e054fbec41177b95372c7add>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/strategy-research/PositionAttribution/shape/immutable-version/1546f4be8593f8b2da423607>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/strategy-research/PositionAttribution/shape/immutable-version/af9bccfcc999a1901c9cfbc3>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/strategy-research/PositionAttribution/shape/participant-role-attributedPositionLot/c1327c7e29292107ca1b8614>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/strategy-research/PositionAttribution/shape/participant-role-attributedPositionSnapshot/22d51ce5ed3d31e6448559f6>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/strategy-research/PositionAttribution/shape/participant-role-attributionCalculationContext/b78f9e17c50c43a21d5d1b06>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/strategy-research/PositionAttribution/shape/participant-role-attributionForPerformance/35e25f4498717c39a8dc9f17>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/strategy-research/PositionAttribution/shape/participant-role-attributionGenerator/f2ebff578450787ff99dff01>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/strategy-research/PositionAttribution/shape/participant-role-attributionMethod/407fe010fcd76b996ed6956d>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/strategy-research/PositionAttribution/shape/participant-role-attributionMetric/2c6e0382b6bcc821b74abddd>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/strategy-research/PositionAttribution/shape/participa